# Keep Docker build contexts small and avoid accidentally copying local artefacts.
#
# This repo uses two build contexts:
# - `.`               (web, learning-worker, keycloak)
# - `./h5p-service`   (H5P sidecar)
#
# The sidecar has its own `.dockerignore`; keep this file focused on the root
# context.

# VCS
.git/

# Python artefacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Node artefacts (defense-in-depth; also handled in `h5p-service/.dockerignore`)
**/node_modules/
**/*.tgz
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Temp / local-only runtime data
.tmp/
tmp/
supabase/storage/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
